A program that verifies whether a given proof is valid according to the rules of a ${fref("journeys/programming-language-theory/concepts/formal-system.td")}, confirming that each step correctly follows from the ${fref("journeys/programming-language-theory/concepts/axiom.td")}s and ${fref("journeys/programming-language-theory/concepts/inference-rule.td")}s.
